<h2>Freshdesk pricing at a glance</h2><p>The official Freshdesk pricing page checked October 29, 2026 displays annual-billing prices of US$19 per agent/month for Growth, US$55 for Pro and US$89 for Enterprise. The page includes a Monthly/Annually selector; this guide uses the visible annual rates, not an unverified month-to-month amount. <a href="https://www.freshworks.com/freshdesk/pricing/">Check the current official price and billing selector before purchase.</a></p>
<div class="publication-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Plan</th><th>Published annual rate</th><th>Included workflow</th><th>Consider it when</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Growth</th><td>US$19 per agent/month, billed annually. Checked October 29, 2026. <a href="https://www.freshworks.com/freshdesk/pricing/">Official pricing</a>.</td><td>Ticketing, shared inbox, customer portal, knowledge base, standard analytics and reporting, threads and tasks, roles and permissions.</td><td>Your team needs a structured email-first help desk and standard reporting.</td></tr><tr><th>Pro</th><td>US$55 per agent/month, billed annually. Checked October 29, 2026. <a href="https://www.freshworks.com/freshdesk/pricing/">Official pricing</a>.</td><td>Growth features plus multilingual help desk, custom dashboards, intelligent routing, multiple SLA policies and external collaborators.</td><td>Routing, reporting and SLA requirements have grown beyond the basics.</td></tr><tr><th>Enterprise</th><td>US$89 per agent/month, billed annually. Checked October 29, 2026. <a href="https://www.freshworks.com/freshdesk/pricing/">Official pricing</a>.</td><td>Higher-tier features including Freddy AI Insights, skill-based routing, sandbox, audit logs and domain/IP controls.</td><td>You need the additional controls and have a reason to maintain them.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
