    ['question'=>'Which tool is better for AI support?','answer'=>'Freshworks says new customers on Growth, Pro or Enterprise receive a one-time complimentary 500-session allowance, with extra packs at US$49 per 100 for the current billing cycle. Help Scout lists Envoy at US$0.75 per resolution. These meters are not directly comparable without expected volume.'],
